<strong>Resource Management</strong></u>:\u00a0<i>You will need to carefully manage your resources, such as batteries for your flashlight or video camera, and other useful items you find along the way.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/e758bd24a02531a305d30b6986991248.avif?t=1754459929\" data-has-big /></span><i></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stealth and Evasion</u>:\u00a0</strong><i>Facing threats directly is not always the best option. Often, you will need to use stealth to avoid being detected by paranormal entities and other dangers. </i><br><br><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/9d8ba771eb1e1435720e011bd880fcfd.avif?t=1754459929\" data-has-big /></span><i> </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Environmental Interaction</u>:</strong>\u00a0<i>You can interact with various objects in the environment to gather information, unlock new areas, or trigger specific events.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiplayer</strong></u><strong>:</strong> <i>Mental also offers a multiplayer mode where you can collaborate with other players to face certain challenges together.</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mental: The Dark Night is currently in early development. Since 2021, its Alpha version has been evolving. At this point, the basic structure (skeleton) of Mental is already built. Currently, development is focused on the story, interactions, techniques, maps, usable items, and more.<br><br><i>Updates and news related to the game's development will be communicated via social media.</i></h2>",
